---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="How it works — Define → Generate → Orchestrate → Execute → Learn" description="4 phases with time boxes: Interviews 7d → Map 2d → Roadmap 3d → Transform continuous — adapted to LightSpeed's registry → generator → MessageBus → AgentLoop → Memory.">
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="ls-inner max-w-[880px] text-center">
      <div class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Methodology</div>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)]">How it works</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] max-w-[60ch] mx-auto">Foaster's 4 phases take 10 days with humans. Ours takes 45 seconds to generate — then governance keeps it compounding.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ls-shell max-w-[880px] space-y-6 py-8">
    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white grid place-items-center text-[0.78rem] font-mono">01</span>
        <span class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Define · 45s · company-registry.yaml</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-[1.25rem]">Define — Single source of truth</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">19 YAML configs (agents, departments, workflows, models). Typed via <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem]">registry/validator.py</code> → <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem]">Pydantic models.py</code>. CWD-independent via <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem]">AI_COMPANY_ROOT</code>.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 rounded-[10px] bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] border border-[var(--ls-divider)] p-3 font-mono text-[0.78rem] overflow-auto">company:<br/>  name: Light Speed Holdings<br/>  agents: [chief_of_staff, cto, … 135]</div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-accent)] text-white grid place-items-center text-[0.78rem] font-mono">02</span>
        <span class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Generate · 45s · Jinja2</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-[1.25rem]">Generate — 135 agents in one command</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]"><code>python -c "from ai_company.generator import AgentGenerator; AgentGenerator().generate_all()"</code> → <code>.opencode/agents/*.md</code> (mode: subagent + permission blocks). Deterministic, 12 templates.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 text-[0.78rem]"><span class="rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] px-3 py-1">12 Jinja2</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] px-3 py-1">Pydantic</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] px-3 py-1">uv run</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-accent-2)] text-white grid place-items-center text-[0.78rem] font-mono">03</span>
        <span class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Orchestrate · &lt;2 min · MessageBus</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-[1.25rem]">Orchestrate — Governed queue</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]"><code>MessageBus</code> at <code>.opencode/inbox.json</code> — JSON task queue with leases, FileStore locking, 5-tier approval matrix, HITL expiry sweep wired into daemon.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white grid place-items-center text-[0.78rem] font-mono">04</span>
        <span class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Execute &amp; Learn · continuous · AgentLoop</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-[1.25rem]">Execute &amp; Learn — ReAct + Memory + Audit</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]"><code>AgentLoop</code> (ReAct) → <code>ToolRunner</code> (shlex, tier_rules, audit via <code>log_tool_call</code>) → <code>MemoryEngine</code> 6 types → <code>GraphEngine</code> BFS → <code>AuditWriter</code> JSONL → <code>GovernanceScheduler</code>.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 rounded-[12px] bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white p-4 font-mono text-[0.78rem]">dashboard live → GET /api/v1/company-kpis + WS task/KPI<br/>http://127.0.0.1:8420 (prod :8420, staging :8421)</div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] border border-[var(--ls-divider)] p-6 text-center">
      <p class="font-medium">AI transformation starts when the company can finally see — and generate — itself.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/platform" class="rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.9rem] font-medium">Explore platform →</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-ink)] px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.9rem] font-medium">Book deployment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
